{"title": "Cloak of Elemental Absorption", "pageid": 9682, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Cloak_of_Elemental_Absorption", "categories": ["Bugs", "Cloaks", "Uncommon items", "Sources of damage reduction", "Elemental set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-uncommon\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cloak_of_Elemental_Absorption_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Cloak_of_Elemental_Absorption_Faded.png/300px-Cloak_of_Elemental_Absorption_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/f/f2/Cloak_of_Elemental_Absorption_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Cloak of Elemental Absorption image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Cloak_of_Elemental_Absorption_Faded.png/300px-Cloak_of_Elemental_Absorption_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Cloak_of_Elemental_Absorption_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Cloak of Elemental Absorption</span></a> is an uncommon <a href=\"/wiki/Cloaks\" title=\"Cloaks\">Cloak</a> that allows the wearer to absorb a small amount of magical damage, and add it to their next attack.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A favourite among fleet-footed gish, this cloak allows the wearer to wield a foe's elemental mastery against them.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cloaks\" title=\"Cloaks\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Cloaks_Icon.png/25px-Cloaks_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Cloaks_Icon.png/38px-Cloaks_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Cloaks_Icon.png/50px-Cloaks_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cloaks\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Cloaks_Icon.png/25px-Cloaks_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/Cloaks_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cloaks\" title=\"Cloaks\">Cloaks</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Uncommon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Uncommon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 115 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  115  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_ElementalGish_AbsorbElements_Cloak</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_ElementalGish_AbsorbElements_Cloak\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_ElementalGish_AbsorbElements_Cloak\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">811ab129-2fb2-49ed-af29-5042197022fe</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:811ab129-2fb2-49ed-af29-5042197022fe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:811ab129-2fb2-49ed-af29-5042197022fe\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_ElementalGish_AbsorbElements_Cloak</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_ElementalGish_AbsorbElements_Cloak+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_ElementalGish_AbsorbElements_Cloak+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Absorb_Elements\" title=\"Absorb Elements\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/Absorb_Elements_Icon.webp/40px-Absorb_Elements_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/Absorb_Elements_Icon.webp/60px-Absorb_Elements_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/Absorb_Elements_Icon.webp/80px-Absorb_Elements_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Absorb Elements\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/Absorb_Elements_Icon.webp/40px-Absorb_Elements_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a4/Absorb_Elements_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Absorb_Elements\" title=\"Absorb Elements\">Absorb Elements</a> (<span aria-label=\"Reaction\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reaction\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Absorb elemental damage once per <a href=\"/wiki/Short_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short Rest\">Short Rest</a>. Take half damage from the next elemental attack targeting you, and deal an additional 1d6 of that element type on your next attack. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-170&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-171</span>: In an opulent chest in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ketheric_Thorm\" title=\"Ketheric Thorm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/38px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/50px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ketheric Thorm's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ketheric_Thorm\" title=\"Ketheric Thorm\">Ketheric Thorm's</a> chambers on the second floor</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Absorb Elements additional elemental damage applies only to weapon attacks, and can apply its damage bonus <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_rider_as_source\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage rider as source\">multiple times</a> to a single weapon attack.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Due to a coding error, Absorb Elements only functions once per Long Rest instead of once per Short Rest.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 341.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 339.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cloak_of_elemental_absorption.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Dyed variations\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Cloak_of_elemental_absorption.png/509px-Cloak_of_elemental_absorption.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Cloak_of_elemental_absorption.png/764px-Cloak_of_elemental_absorption.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Cloak_of_elemental_absorption.png/1018px-Cloak_of_elemental_absorption.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dyed variations\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Cloak_of_elemental_absorption.png/509px-Cloak_of_elemental_absorption.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"340\" height=\"400\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Cloak_of_elemental_absorption.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dye\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dye\">Dyed</a> variations</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195315\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.069 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.07